WEBVTT

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:19.290
Woohoo!

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.540
Where am I?

00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:23.350
Why?

00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:25.330
We're playing hunter and prey, huh?

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:27.150
I won't lose!

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:38.600
Huh? They hid...

00:01:43.880 --> 00:01:45.600
There!

00:01:56.050 --> 00:01:59.060
P-Please don't eat me!

00:01:59.060 --> 00:02:00.640
I won't eat you!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.860
Sorry! I just love playing hunter and prey.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:14.150
You must be an animal that 
doesn't like it so much, huh?

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.180
Um...

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.160
Erm...

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:32.950
Feeling better?

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:35.420
No. Um, yes. I'm okay.

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:38.600
Are you from here?

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.840
What is this place?

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.960
This is Japari Park!

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:48.520
Order: Carnivora 
Family: Felidae
Genus: Felis

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.570
I'm Serval.

00:02:45.570 --> 00:02:47.790
This is my territory.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.440
Serval-san?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:54.900
Then your ears and tail are...

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:57.790
Why? Is something unusual?

00:02:57.790 --> 00:03:01.220
What about you? A Friend 
without a tail or ears?

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:02.500
Now that's unusual!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:03.650
A "Friend"?

00:03:03.650 --> 00:03:06.210
Where'd you come from? 
Where's your territory?

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.660
I don't know.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.990
I don't remember.

00:03:10.990 --> 00:03:13.130
When I woke up, I was here...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:17.550
Oh, maybe you were born 
from last night's Sandstar!

00:03:17.550 --> 00:03:19.450
"Sandstar"?

00:03:19.450 --> 00:03:22.700
Yup! It came flying out of 
that mountain yesterday.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.550
The area's still all sparkly from it, see?

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:29.890
Now, let's find out what 
kind of Friend you are...

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.530
A bird would have wings back here!

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:34.160
Huh, nothing...

00:03:34.570 --> 00:03:37.000
If you have a hood, you're a snake!

00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.940
But you don't. Huh?

00:03:40.710 --> 00:03:42.860
Huh? What's this?

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.590
Huh? A bag (<i>kaban</i>), I guess.

00:03:45.590 --> 00:03:48.450
Kaban? Kaban...

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.140
Kaban... Kaban!

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:53.680
Is that a clue?

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:55.540
Dunno!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.660
You might have to go to the library 
to find out what you are...

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.010
The library?

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:04.550
Yup. When there's something you 
don't know, you ask at the library.

00:04:04.550 --> 00:04:08.310
They'd know what kind of animal I am?

00:04:08.920 --> 00:04:11.700
Thank you very much, Serval-san.

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:15.520
Where can I find the library?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.490
I'll take you part of the way.

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:18.590
Come on, let's go!

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.870
Oh, thank you.

00:04:20.870 --> 00:04:22.740
I'd appreciate that.

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:27.120
Wait, what should I call you until then?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.240
Kaban-chan! How's that?

00:04:30.240 --> 00:04:32.980
Okay! Thank you.

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:38.840
Guide, guide, savanna guide!

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:48.520
It's so vast, and the view's great, right?

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:51.520
It's called the Savanna Area.

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:55.680
Is this area your territory alone, Serval-san?

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:59.110
No way! Tons of other animals live here, too.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.020
For instance...

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:07.330
Zebra-chan's over there.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.450
Huh? I don't see her.

00:05:10.450 --> 00:05:12.730
Oops, I guess she hid.

00:05:12.730 --> 00:05:14.300
Who else...

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:17.680
Thomson's Gazelle-chan is to that side.

00:05:17.680 --> 00:05:19.670
Oh, I see her!

00:05:20.010 --> 00:05:22.410
And there are many more of us, too!

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:27.380
The Savanna Area's big, 
so there are loads of Friends here.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.150
The library's beyond the Jungle Area.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.650
I'll take you as far as the Savanna exit.

00:05:32.650 --> 00:05:36.070
Is the exit very far?

00:05:36.070 --> 00:05:37.570
It's a stone's throw away.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:39.400
Come on, let's go!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:43.030
Huh?

00:05:52.740 --> 00:05:54.420
Come on, hurry!

00:05:59.650 --> 00:06:01.460
You move slowly...

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:05.450
Maybe you're a sloth Friend?

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.970
Huh? A sloth?

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:12.060
Are you okay?

00:06:12.740 --> 00:06:13.970
I'm sorry.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:25.640
I'm sorry.

00:06:25.640 --> 00:06:30.030
Don't worry about it. Different 
Friends are good at different things.

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:48.290
Are you a Friend?

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.280
Oh, no! That's a Cerulean!

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:53.140
Run!

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:02.310
Meow meow meow meow...

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.900
Hi-yah!

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.340
That's called a Cerulean.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:18.790
They're a little dangerous, 
so be careful, okay?

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:24.000
I can take care of the little ones with 
these awesome claws of mine, though.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.070
You're incredible, Serval-san.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.880
I don't have any power like that.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:32.430
Even just following you is hard for me.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:36.760
I guess I'm a pretty pathetic animal, huh?

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:44.540
Don't worry. Everybody's always 
calling me clumsy and super weak.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:48.170
Besides, you're a really hard worker.

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:51.200
I'm sure we'll find out what you're 
good at before you know it.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:00.360
Let's take a little break here.

00:08:00.920 --> 00:08:05.370
When the sun's the hottest, 
you have to be careful not to overdo it.

00:08:06.170 --> 00:08:10.770
We'll drink some water later. 
I know a good place.

00:08:12.960 --> 00:08:17.550
If we were bird Friends, 
we could fly there in no time...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:21.560
Are there many kinds of Friends?

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:24.510
There sure are! There are lots 
of Friends from the cat family

00:08:24.510 --> 00:08:27.360
who are stronger and scarier 
and bigger than me.

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:30.800
D-Do they bite?

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:35.780
No way! Only once in a while, 
when they're in a bad mood.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:38.120
O-Oh, okay...

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:42.650
But watch out for those Ceruleans!

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:46.080
There actually shouldn't be many in this area...

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:50.050
Your claw attack back there was amazing.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:54.570
It's a Friend skill. If we run into 
another one, you leave it to me.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.650
Thank you...

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:04.840
Huh? Kaban-chan, you don't pant?

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.730
And you already have your energy back.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:11.870
That's amazing after we walked so much.

00:09:11.870 --> 00:09:13.530
I-Is it?

00:09:13.530 --> 00:09:18.120
I'm starting to see your strong points.

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:22.330
I bet you're an awesome animal. 
This is gonna be fun!

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:52.210
Tama Zoo, Shinzaki-oniisan (Tokyo)

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:28.690
Servals generally live in the African savanna.

00:09:28.690 --> 00:09:31.410
The grass grows fairly high there,

00:09:31.410 --> 00:09:35.220
so servals have slender bodies to 
help them walk through such areas.

00:09:35.220 --> 00:09:39.790
Also, because their ears are so big, 
they can hear noises from far away.

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.350
As for their jumping strength...

00:09:42.350 --> 00:09:46.330
The serval is an animal that
can easily jump very high.

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.170
They like high places,

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:52.320
so they can jump up a meter 
or two with no problem.

00:09:52.890 --> 00:09:54.590
Those are amazing trees...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:56.440
They're huge, right?

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:59.410
The savanna is dotted with trees.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:01.900
That reminds me!

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:06.040
If you can climb trees, they're helpful 
when you need to run or hide.

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:07.770
Want to try it?

00:10:07.770 --> 00:10:08.600
Huh?

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:13.170
Meow, meow, meow!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:15.100
Easy, right?

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.220
I can't do that.

00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:19.970
How about on this one?

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.600
Up you go!

00:10:34.640 --> 00:10:36.740
Isn't tree-climbing great?

00:10:42.300 --> 00:10:45.080
The watering hole's that way. Shall we?

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.670
Water!

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:25.850
It's delicious!

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:34.630
We walked pretty far, huh?

00:11:37.710 --> 00:11:40.290
That's the shade tree where we took our break!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:41.380
It is!

00:11:41.380 --> 00:11:43.540
Enjoying the scenery while drinking water

00:11:43.540 --> 00:11:46.760
really brings you back to life.
I'm full of energy!

00:11:46.760 --> 00:11:49.770
You've been energetic this whole time.

00:11:50.430 --> 00:11:53.860
It's weird, though. It's so empty today.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:56.960
Usually, you have to claim a spot.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:00.330
I wonder if someone scary came by...

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:02.200
Huh?

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.160
Who's there?

00:12:07.290 --> 00:12:08.760
D-Don't eat me!

00:12:08.760 --> 00:12:11.620
Pardon me. I was bathing.

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:12.830
Oh, it's Hippo!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:17.340
Order: Artiodactyla
Family: Hippopotamidae
Genus: Hippopotamus

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:17.340
How rare for you to come all 
the way here to play, Serval.

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.550
I'm going to the gate today.

00:12:19.550 --> 00:12:21.380
I wanted to drink some water first.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.070
Not many Friends out today, huh?

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:28.510
The Ceruleans are out in force today. 
It's hard for anyone to go out and about.

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:33.440
I hear there's a larger one 
by the gate. Do be careful.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:36.270
Okay, I'll kick its butt, then!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:39.490
You, Serval? How worrying.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:42.280
It'll be fine! I just beat one earlier.

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.010
A small one, I'm sure.

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:46.280
H-How did you know?

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.240
By the way, who's your companion?

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.030
This is Kaban-chan.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.370
"Kaban"?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:55.370
I've never heard of that kind of animal.

00:12:55.370 --> 00:12:59.480
I came up with the name 'cause she says 
she doesn't know what kind of animal she is.

00:12:59.480 --> 00:13:02.300
So I thought it would be a good 
idea to go to the library.

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:05.380
Do you know what kind of animal she is?

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.700
Hmm... Can you swim?

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.760
No.

00:13:09.760 --> 00:13:11.510
Can you fly?

00:13:11.510 --> 00:13:12.550
No.

00:13:12.550 --> 00:13:14.830
Then are you fast?

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:16.230
No...

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:18.660
You can't do anything at all, can you?

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.900
Th-That's not true!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.960
Well, there are also animals like Serval.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:27.760
Fast, a good sense of smell, 
and good hearing,

00:13:27.760 --> 00:13:31.910
but so silly that it all goes to waste.

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.510
So it's nothing to fret about.

00:13:33.510 --> 00:13:34.890
That's mean.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:36.690
Why, I can't swim, myself.

00:13:36.690 --> 00:13:38.290
Huh? You can't?

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:43.500
But the rule here in Japari Park 
is that you must fend for yourself.

00:13:43.930 --> 00:13:46.510
You need to protect yourself.

00:13:47.420 --> 00:13:49.170
You can't leave it all to Serval.

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:49.920
Okay.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.210
Well, we're gonna go.

00:13:53.750 --> 00:13:57.150
If you run into a Cerulean, it's best to run.

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:59.020
If you have no choice but to fight,

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.730
aim for the stone.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:00.730
Got it!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:05.540
Also, be careful of the heat. 
Especially you, Serval!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:08.170
You hardly sweat,

00:14:08.170 --> 00:14:10.770
so you should drink lots of water while you can—

00:14:09.390 --> 00:14:10.770
Okay!

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:15.370
Also, take care not to twist 
your ankles on slopes.

00:14:15.370 --> 00:14:16.800
We'll be fine!

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:19.600
We're almost to the gate.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.750
The flat thing here is a landmark.

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:25.090
You're very knowledgeable, Serval-san.

00:14:27.290 --> 00:14:30.220
You can almost see the Savanna Area exit!

00:14:30.990 --> 00:14:32.280
Really?

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:40.680
Huh? What's that?

00:14:40.680 --> 00:14:42.690
You can see where the Areas are?

00:14:43.350 --> 00:14:48.400
Right now, we're in the Savanna Area, 
and the Jungle Area is next door, so...

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:50.060
We must be here!

00:14:50.060 --> 00:14:52.960
That's great! Where did you find it?

00:14:52.960 --> 00:14:54.380
It was in here.

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:56.990
What? I had no idea!

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:58.560
How did you get it out?

00:15:03.630 --> 00:15:06.000
What's the matter, Serval-san?

00:15:11.930 --> 00:15:14.120
Is that a Cerulean, too?

00:15:14.120 --> 00:15:18.570
That scream... It might be eating someone...

00:15:18.570 --> 00:15:20.350
E-Eating someone?!

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:22.020
We have to rescue them!

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:32.790
Huh? There's no stone!

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:34.280
Where is it?

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.980
It doesn't have a stone! How come?

00:15:53.440 --> 00:15:56.140
Serval-san! On the Cerulean's back!

00:15:58.390 --> 00:15:59.300
Yeah!

00:15:59.300 --> 00:16:01.850
You're right! It's on its back!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:03.940
Come on!

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:05.120
Come on!

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:10.440
It keeps watching me. Look away!

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.380
What do I do?

00:16:15.380 --> 00:16:17.760
I've never seen one like this before.

00:16:33.260 --> 00:16:35.700
Now's your chance! Serval-san!

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:42.930
Meow!

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:56.700
Challenging me to a battle of big 
mouths? You have some nerve.

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.830
Hi-yah!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:11.350
Serval always seems to fall short...

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:13.840
This is the only time I'm 
going to bail you out, okay?

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.140
What a strange child.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.730
But you did try to help Serval...

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:21.240
Serval-san?!

00:17:24.010 --> 00:17:25.230
Thank goodness.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:40.700
That was amazing! What was it?

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:41.590
Huh?

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:46.310
Amazing! What was that thing?

00:17:46.310 --> 00:17:50.790
That thing that flew through the air! 
What was it? How'd you do that?

00:17:51.470 --> 00:17:54.040
Y-You mean the paper airplane?

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:55.800
I made it...

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:57.940
You <i>made</i> that?!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.940
Well, be careful!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:10.050
If you say that you want to go to the library,

00:18:10.050 --> 00:18:13.980
the Friends in the Jungle Area should 
show you the way to the next Area.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:15.990
Thank you so much.

00:18:16.890 --> 00:18:18.030
For everything.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:22.080
If not for you, Serval-san, I'd be...

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:25.290
Kaban-chan, you have some amazing skills!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.570
No matter what happens, you'll be fine.

00:18:27.570 --> 00:18:31.880
When you find out what kind of animal you are, 
drop by the Savanna Area again, okay?

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:33.710
Yes, I definitely will!

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:38.310
Oh, yeah! Next time we meet, 
call me "Serval-chan."

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:42.650
You don't have to be polite, either,
'cause we're friends now!

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:43.720
I will!

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:45.890
Thank you.

00:18:46.700 --> 00:18:49.190
Well, I'll be going now.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:26.720
P-Please don't eat me!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.030
I won't eat you!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:36.520
Serval-san? Why?

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.940
I'm really curious, so I thought 
I'd go with you a little further.

00:19:40.470 --> 00:19:42.380
Serval-san...

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.770
Hey, you promised, remember?

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:49.040
That the next time we met, you'd call me 
Serval-chan, and talk more casually, too.

00:19:50.230 --> 00:19:52.540
But we only just said goodbye!

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.770
We did it, so it counts.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:56.130
You think so?

00:19:57.770 --> 00:19:59.510
Come on, let's go, let's go!

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:08.320
Where should we go tomorrow?

00:20:08.320 --> 00:20:12.350
I heard the Jungle Area has this big river.

00:20:12.350 --> 00:20:14.800
I can't wait!

00:20:14.800 --> 00:20:17.290
You're so full of energy, Serval-chan.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:22.380
I've had a long day. I think that's it for me...

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.700
I'm nocturnal.

00:20:24.700 --> 00:20:28.750
Also, they say there are lots of 
Friends in the Jungle Area, too.

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:31.760
Sounds like there's tons of fun waiting!

00:20:31.760 --> 00:20:33.860
Serval-chan, that's dangerous.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.830
Don't worry, I'm nocturnal!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.830
Serval-chan!

00:20:40.700 --> 00:20:42.600
That startled me...

00:20:42.600 --> 00:20:44.340
Be careful, okay?

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:53.770
Serval-chan, behind you!

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:06.250
Boss!

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:08.600
Huh?

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.840
It's okay. This is a friend of mine.

00:21:10.840 --> 00:21:15.020
Boss, she doesn't know 
what kind of animal she is.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:18.050
Will you show us to where she... lives...

00:21:21.740 --> 00:21:26.020
Hello. I am Lucky Beast.

00:21:26.020 --> 00:21:27.240
It is nice to meet you.

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.560
Hello. Nice to meet you.

00:21:30.970 --> 00:21:32.330
I'm Kaban.

00:21:32.330 --> 00:21:34.680
What's the matter, Serval-chan?

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:39.060
Whoa! You talked!

00:23:13.720 --> 00:23:15.980
Smells like they're passing through here...

00:23:16.460 --> 00:23:18.450
We have to catch them quickly!

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:21.400
Now, now, let's take our time.

00:23:21.400 --> 00:23:23.460
It'll be a long trip.

00:23:23.460 --> 00:23:27.230
Unacceptable! If they escape us any longer...

00:23:27.230 --> 00:23:28.840
If they escape...

00:23:29.520 --> 00:23:31.800
The park will be in grave danger!

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:33.970
The park will be in danger, huh?

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:36.280
I'll go with you, Raccoon-san.

00:23:36.280 --> 00:23:39.480
We must capture them at once!

00:23:39.480 --> 00:23:40.720
Aye aye.

00:23:41.780 --> 00:23:43.040
PPP Preview!

00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:45.260
This week, we're learning about jaguars.

00:23:45.260 --> 00:23:47.340
They're rain deities? What does that mean?

00:23:47.340 --> 00:23:48.230
Do they pray for rain?

00:23:48.230 --> 00:23:49.740
Royal, you try it!

00:23:50.320 --> 00:23:53.930
Rain, rain, come down?

00:23:53.930 --> 00:23:54.590
That sucked.

00:23:54.590 --> 00:23:56.330
Next time, "Jungle Area"!
